OL,3,GNEWSASuspect in double murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation found dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the murder of two
OL,7,Fmen in Glasgow have said a suspect has
OL,8,Fbeen found dead.
OL,10,FThe bodies of Paul Lafferty, 50, and
OL,11,FGary Beaton, 54, were discovered in a
OL,12,Fflat in Partick's Chancellor Street at
OL,13,Fabout 16:40 on Sunday 16 August. They
OL,14,Fare believed to have been stabbed.
OL,16,FA 38-year-old man was found seriously
OL,17,Finjured the following day in the city's
OL,18,FBroomielaw area beneath the George V
OL,19,FBridge. He was pronounced dead at the
OL,20,Fscene and his death is not being
OL,21,Ftreated as suspicious.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
